  - id: intro
    englishSubtitles: "Hey, I need you to do me a favour, can you to grab the cordless
      drill and bring it back to me. It\u2019s over in the compound sitting on the
      concrete blocks. Be quick! I\u2019m under a bit of pressure to get this job
      done"
